# Paddle's default payment link is https://justglide.app/checkout, because justglide.app is the
# only domain Paddle approved for this account. The page itself lives on the Glide proxy, and a
# custom domain for that proxy is a paid Specific feature we deliberately do not buy. A 200
# rewrite is a reverse proxy, so the buyer stays on the approved domain while Netlify fetches
# the page from the proxy. Status 200, NOT 301: a redirect would move the buyer to an
# unapproved domain and Paddle would reject the checkout.
# The splat rule must come first, and it carries /checkout/fonts/*.woff2 too.
/checkout/*  https://black-yak.spcf.app/checkout/:splat  200
/checkout    https://black-yak.spcf.app/checkout         200

/community  /community.html  200
/pricing  /pricing.html  200
/r/*  /r/index.html  200
